This directory holds the standard that defines the nodes and the tokens of the toml language, copied unchanged and pinned: README.md names its source and the version pinned.

- toml.abnf: the ABNF grammar of TOML 1.1.0, from github.com/toml-lang/toml at the tag 1.1.0.
